    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to:"
